  "externalUrl": "http://www.eurogamer.net/articles/2015-05-18-the-witcher-3-wild-hunt-review",
  "snippet": "It will last you months, yet not waste your time. Above all, it has a vivid, enduring personality, something that is exceedingly rare among its breed of mega-budget open-world epics (and that will probably be rarer still once Hideo Kojima and Konami part ways later this year). For my money, it's the greatest role-playing game in years.",
